    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Key insights",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 17
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What the season says\n\n**1. Bowling is already semi-final standard.**\nEconomy 7.36 vs 7.48 for the 4 semi-finalists, and 8.7 wickets a match (4th of 16).\nThe middle overs are the best phase: economy 6.73, 4th of 16.\n\n**2. The gap is the bat: about 21 runs an innings.**\nWe average 133; the semi-finalists average 154.\nRun rate 7.12 vs 8.37, and a boundary every 6.9 balls vs 5.2.\n\n**3. The runs go missing in all 3 phases.**\nPowerplay 6.43 vs 7.77 \u00b7 middle 7.24 vs 8.39 \u00b7 death 7.94 vs 9.44.\nWe protect wickets early (4th fewest lost) but don't cash them in.\n\n**4. Overs 7-15 are where innings break.**\n4.2 wickets lost, 11th of 16 (semi-finalists lose 3.6).\n\n**5. Leaking at both ends with the ball.**\nPowerplay and death economy are both 12th of 16.\n\n**6. Continuity.**\nWe used 26 batters across 9 games (13th of 16); the semi-finalists average 20.\n\n**7. Run-outs:** 0.33 a match, 12th of 16 (semi-finalists 0.78).\n\n<small>Source: CricClubs, NACL Summer 2026 Div A, all 68 matches. Ranks are out of 16 teams.</small>"
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Where Astros+ ranks (out of 16) vs the semi-finalists",
      "description": "Rank 1 = best in Div A for that metric. Green = top 5, red = bottom 5.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "eg0dslgx3y0w0b"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 9,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 15,
        "h": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "eg0dslgx3y0w0b"
          },
          "rawSql": "SELECT r.category AS \"Area\", r.metric AS \"Metric\", r.value AS \"Astros+\", r.rank AS \"Rank\",\n       r.top4_avg AS \"Semi-finalists avg\",\n       r.league_avg AS \"League avg\", r.best_team || ' (' || r.best_value || ')' AS \"Best in Div A\"\nFROM cricket.team_ranks r\nWHERE r.team = 'Astros+' AND r.season = 'Summer 2026'\nORDER BY r.sort_order",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
